ariant:normal;font-weight:400;margin:0px;padding:0px;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e中城國小 (Zhongcheng Elementary School) ⏰ 07:00 – 14:00\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);clear:both;color:rgb(125, 125, 125);font-family:微軟正黑體, Tahoma, Verdana, Arial;font-size:19.5px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.38;margin:14pt 0px 4pt;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\" id=\"ef4933a016acd26ee65890fcbaf12c601\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;margin:0px;padding:0px;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;\"\u003e工作內容 | Responsibilities\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:微軟正黑體, Tahoma, Verdana, Arial;font-size:18px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.38;margin:12pt 0px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;margin:0px;padding:0px;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e✅ 帶領英語闖關活動 Lead English challenge activities\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;margin:0px;padding:0px;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e✅ 參與兩次籌備會議與行前細項流程會議 Attend two preparatory meetings and a pre-camp briefing\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);clear:both;color:rgb(125, 125, 125);font-family:微軟正黑體, Tahoma, Verdana, Arial;font-size:19.5px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.38;margin:14pt 0px 4pt;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\" id=\"e2b1a4fba4411378ff9fa485c64b5d0c2\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;margin:0px;padding:0px;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;\"\u003e隊輔待遇 | Benefits\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:微軟正黑體, Tahoma, Verdana, Arial;font-size:18px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.38;margin:12pt 0px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;margin:0px;padding:0px;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e💰 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;margin:0px;padding:0px;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;\"\u003e工讀時薪\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;margin:0px;padding:0px;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e（大進國小 10 小時，中城國小 12 小時）\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;margin:0px;padding:0px;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;\"\u003ePaid hourly wage\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;margin:0px;padding:0px;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e (10 hours for Dajin Elementary, 12 hours for Zhongcheng Elementary)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;margin:0px;padding:0px;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e📌 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;margin:0px;padding:0px;text-decoration:non